# =============================================================
# 截图 5 项最终提交材料之外的内容
# 保留核心：
# 1. 源码与测试 (guarded_harness/, tests/)
# 2. pytest -q 实际结果 (evidence/pytest-result.txt)
# 3. 完整运行记录与产物 (evidence/real-test-fix/)
# 4. 审计记录 (evidence/real-test-fix/run/audit.jsonl)
# 5. Checkpoint 恢复记录 (evidence/Checkpoint恢复记录.md)
# =============================================================
/docs/
/examples/
/scripts/
SHA256SUMS.txt

